    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "bjRet",
      "x": 3460,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "C · Cursor vs selection",
      "width": 1180,
      "fill": "#f3f0e9",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ndA9o",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#161616",
          "content": "C · A keyboard cursor, separate from the pick",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sDs5V",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• The cursor is a ❯ in the gutter plus a row tint. The pick is the ● / ○ radio. Moving the cursor never changes the pick: space picks, enter picks and goes to Next.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eCJ8F",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• The cursor shows the moment the gate takes focus (a click in, or a pane switch), so the first ↓ visibly moves it. Variant if you prefer: show nothing until the first key, and that key only reveals the cursor without moving it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e339W",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• When the cursor leaves the options for the buttons, the option rows lose their tint and ▸, and the focused button gets ▸ and a bright outline, so you can always tell where the keys are.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "oOLdF",
          "name": "Row 1",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
